BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 760 Tm (Harbor Lantern Society - Minutes of the Autumn Meeting) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 728 Tm (The meeting was called to order by Marta Quill at seven in the evening.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 712 Tm (Mr. Edric Fenwick read the minutes of the previous session, which were) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 696 Tm (approved without amendment. Dr. Ilsa Moorcroft reported that the lantern) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 680 Tm (on the east pier had been repaired by the Northgate Rope Company.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 664 Tm (1. The treasurer presented the accounts for the quarter.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 648 Tm (Members thanked Mr. Fenwick for his careful work on the ledger.) Tj ET
endstream
