7 0 obj
<< /Length 847 >>
stream
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 760 Tm (Old Business) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 728 Tm (Marta Quill noted that the Society had written twice to the Northgate Rope) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 712 Tm (Company about the frayed mooring lines near the old customs shed, and that) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 696 Tm (after a long exchange of letters, several visits to the yard, a disagreement) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 680 Tm (over the cost of hemp versus manila, and a promise from the foreman that the) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 664 Tm (work would be finished before the first frost, the company had at last agreed) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 648 Tm (to replace every line on the north and east piers at no extra charge to members.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 632 Tm (Dr. Moorcroft asked that the agreement be recorded in full.) Tj ET
endstream
