BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 760 Tm (New Business) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 728 Tm (Edric Fenwick proposed a winter lantern walk along the harbor wall.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 712 Tm (The proposal was seconded by Dr. Moorcroft and carried unanimously.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 696 Tm (Mr. Tobias Wren offered to print notices for the walk at his own expense.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 680 Tm (The meeting was adjourned at half past eight. The next meeting will be) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 664 Tm (held at the Society hall on the first Tuesday of the month.) Tj ET
endstream
